---
/**
 * KonfessiiOverviewCard.astro — planned overview tree card for /konfessii/.
 *
 * Refactoring 6.0 parallel pilot. Preserve legacy DOM/classes/text/inline SVG.
 */
---
<div class="card soon" aria-disabled="true">
  <span class="badge">В РАЗРАБОТКЕ</span>
  <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 360 152" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <rect width="360" height="152" fill="#13120c"></rect>
      <g stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" opacity=".5">
        <path d="M180,76 L100,40"></path><path d="M180,76 L260,40"></path><path d="M180,76 L120,118"></path><path d="M180,76 L240,118"></path>
      </g>
      <circle cx="180" cy="76" r="5" fill="#0d1117" stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
      <circle cx="100" cy="40" r="3.5" fill="#0d1117" stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.3"></circle>
      <circle cx="260" cy="40" r="3.5" fill="#0d1117" stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.3"></circle>
      <circle cx="120" cy="118" r="3.5" fill="#0d1117" stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.3"></circle>
      <circle cx="240" cy="118" r="3.5" fill="#0d1117" stroke="#6b6248" stroke-width="1.3"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="kick">Обзор</div>
    <h2>Древо протестантских течений</h2>
    <div class="sub">Карта родства деноминаций</div>
    <p>Сравнительная карта основных протестантских семей — лютеране, реформаты, баптисты, методисты — и их исторических связей.</p>
    <div class="cta">СКОРО</div>
  </div>
</div>
